ию: false]\n  -y, --yolo                                  Automatically accept all actions (aka YOLO mode, see https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xvFZjo5PgG0 for more details)?\n                                                                                                                                         [булевый тип] [по умолчанию: false]\n      --telemetry                             Enable telemetry? This flag specifically controls if telemetry is sent. Other --telemetry-* flags set specific values but do\n                                              not enable telemetry on their own.                                                                               [булевый тип]\n      --telemetry-target                      Set the telemetry target (local or gcp). Overrides settings files.               [строковой тип] [возможности: \"local\", \"gcp\"]\n      --telemetry-otlp-endpoint               Set the OTLP endpoint for telemetry. Overrides environment variables and settings files.                       [строковой тип]\n      --telemetry-log-prompts                 Enable or disable logging of user prompts for telemetry. Overrides settings files.                               [булевый тип]\n      --telemetry-outfile                     Redirect all telemetry output to the specified file.                                                           [строковой тип]\n  -c, --checkpointing                         Enables checkpointing of file edits                                                        [булевый тип] [по умолчанию: false]\n      --experimental-acp                      Starts the agent in ACP mode                                                                                     [булевый тип]\n      --allowed-mcp-server-names              Allowed MCP server names                                                                                              [массив]\n  -e, --extensions                            A list of extensions to use. If not p